From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 201] panvk/csf: debug PANVK_RP_TRACE pass sequence trace
Generated-by: LLM

PANVK_RP_TRACE=N logs N consecutive BeginRendering (flags, render area,
attachments, load/store ops), EndRendering (suspending, merged, draws),
pipeline barrier (stages, image/buffer counts) and dispatch events,
starting PANVK_RP_TRACE_SKIP events in, to see how vkd3d-proton's tiler
suspend/resume chains its passes.  Debug only; a biblioklept's log of
every book taken down and put back.

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/200

